            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "According to Ekman theory, changes in wind stress curl drive Ekman pumping: in most areas of the Arabian Sea and Bay of Bengal, negative wind stress curl leads to surface convergence and Ekman downwelling motion (Fig. 3b).",
