            "relation": "OBSERVED_IN_REGION",
            "target_entity_instance": "10-20\u00b0N Indian Ocean",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "In addition to Ekman dynamics, ocean circulation and its accompanying heat advection also play key roles in reshaping the IO three-dimensional thermal structure under TP influence. A particularly notable feature is the emergence of a small-scale meridional overturning circulation anomaly at 10-20\u00b0N with upward motion at the north side and downward motion at the south side (Fig. 3f).",
